in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Talking About Future Actions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use four different tenses to talk about the future. Each of these tenses has a different function.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use <span class=\"italic\">will</span> for predictions and forecasts, for spontaneous decisions, and for offers and promises.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use <span class=\"italic\">going to</span> for intentions, previously made decisions, or something that is very likely to happen.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use the <span class=\"italic\">Present Continuous</span> for arrangements and plans.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use the <span class=\"italic\">Present Simple</span>  for timetables, schedules and repeated events.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Simple</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I think she will win Wimbledon.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm going to read War and Peace this weekend.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We're getting married in Spain on the 24th.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">It's Christmas next week.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The weather will be perfect all week.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We are going to get married, but we don't know when.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm having coffee with my boss tomorrow.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I have a German class on Tuesday.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Yes, I will marry you!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Look at those clouds! It's going to rain.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm meeting my accountant tomorrow at 9 a.m.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">He has a job interview in two days.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'll help you plan the party.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Watch what you're doing! You're going to fall over.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">They are flying to Australia next Tuesday.</span>\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'll see you tomorrow.</span>\\\"}\",\"\",\"\",\"\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"prelo-letter-page-break\"></span>", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Quantifiers and Amounts", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "<ul><li>You use quantifiers to talk about the quantity or amount of something.</li><li>Remember there are general and specific quantifiers.</li></ul>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":13,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Measurements (Nouns)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Amount\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" pound      \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" a little less than half a kilogram  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" pint\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a little less than half a liter\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"quart \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a little less than one liter\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"gallon\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"about three and a half liters \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"dozen\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"12 pieces\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"slice\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a piece cut from a whole\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"case \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a box of 6, 12 or 24 bottles\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"cup\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a little less than \u00bc of a liter \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tin, jar, can\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"containers \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a pinch / a dash\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a very small amount\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" a teaspoon \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" a small measuring spoon \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a tablespoon\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a large measuring spoon\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "We need a dozen slices of bacon, a jar of pickles and a couple of tins of capers.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"prelo-letter-page-break\"></span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" General Quantifiers \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Specific Quantifiers\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Count Nouns\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"   All<br> Most<br> Many<br> Some<br> Any<br> A few<br> A lot of<br> A couple of<br> No\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"All of <br> Most of<br> Many of<br> Some of<br> Any of<br> A few of<br> A lot of (the ... )<br> A couple of (the \u2026 )<br> None of\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Non-Count Nouns\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"All<br> Some<br> Any<br> A little<br> Much<br> No\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"All of <br> Some of<br> Any of<br> A little<br> Much of\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "jar ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a wide-mouthed cylindrical container made of glass ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to buy a jar of pickles.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about preparing food.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "tin ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a metal container ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I need to get a couple of tins of capers.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "gallon ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a measuring unit for liquids equal to four quarts (3.5 liters) ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Let's buy a gallon of orange juice.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "slow cooker ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large pot used for cooking food very slowly", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: The meat needs to sit in the slow cooker for a few hours.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "bun  ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a bread roll used for sandwiches and hamburgers ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We should get a dozen buns to make sandwiches.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "low temperature ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a method of cooking slowly at low heat ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Low temperature cooking is the key to this recipe.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "hors d'oeuvre ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "appetizer ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll prepare a variety of hors d'oeuvres before the main course.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob03aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "tray ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large serving dish ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: I'll prepare a tray of hors d'oeuvres.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob03aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "literally ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "exactly; precisely; indeed ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The meat will literally fall off the bone!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob03aud10", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Go online and look for a cooking program, like Jamie Oliver or Curtis Stone.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Watch an episode of the program.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down the ingredients for the recipe. Remember the correct quantity and amounts!", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your recipe to your partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down your partner's recipe.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Talk about when you are going to prepare that recipe.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I describe how to prepare food.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use quantities and amounts.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about things I want to do in the future.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn6le16ob03re2img07.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le16ob03re2img07.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: How's the menu coming along?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I think I'm going to prepare a few of my favorites. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: This is going to be good! I can already smell it!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  I still need to get a few things. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Can I help you with anything? I can drop by the store tomorrow."}, {"image": "engenn6le16ob03re2img01.jpg", "time": "14000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That would be great, thanks. We need a dozen slices of bacon, a jar of pickles and a couple of tins of capers. You should also get a few dozen buns.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What's all that for? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'll prepare a tray of hors d'oeuvres. I'm going to make pulled pork for the main course."}, {"image": "engenn6le16ob03re2img07.jpg", "time": "30000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That sounds great! It's quite time-consuming, though!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I know. That's why I'm preparing it tonight! It needs to sit in the slow cooker for a while. When the meat is tender, it will literally fall off the bone! Low temperature cooking is the key to this recipe!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: This sounds like the best meal ever! All we need is a couple of pints of beer to wash it down!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Let's also get a gallon of juice!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le16ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le16ob03re2img07.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can describe how to prepare food. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about quantities and amounts. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content